# Quality

- Format with Prettier. Do not bypass `format:check` in CI.
- ESLint is required once application source exists. Until then, document the strategy; do not fake an app lint suite.
- Conventional Commits are required.
- Do not weaken GitHub Actions quality gates.
- Do not use `continue-on-error: true` on required CI jobs.
- Do not force-push to `test` or `main`.
